  "body": "## sqly v1.7.8\n\nRun SQL over CSV, TSV, LTSV, JSON, JSONL, Parquet, Excel, ACH, Fedwire, and\nsupported compressed inputs (.gz, .bz2, .xz, .zst, .z, .snappy, .s2, .lz4).\n\nInstall or upgrade, then see the grouped highlights below. Every artifact is\nsigned and ships with an SBOM and build provenance — see\n[Verify a release](https://nao1215.github.io/sqly/install/#verify-a-release).\n\n## Changelog\n### Documentation\n* caf1abd5ccc7c17e246a98b336845fc4fb04d046: docs: name only the filesql change sqly reaches (@nao1215)\n### Others\n* 090239db7f6da7fc53031dde632fa16c683709eb: build(deps): update filesql to v0.60.5 (@nao1215)\n* 5b5083608065e20f0749a37627956e4fd07b0e61: refactor: keep the schema-qualifier rule in one internal package (@nao1215)\n\n**Full changelog**: https://github.com/nao1215/sqly/compare/v1.7.7...v1.7.8\n\n",
